# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): AISLING by name, the main screen (the chord, the scale), a page and a
# knob said once they settle, a button's message (Skellig, AISLING's first: Surf, Motion 40)
wait 200
listen
wait 300
said Aisling page: Filter Off, Evolve 40, Motion 40, Drift 16 bars. Piece Skellig
listen
where
said Scale D, E, F, G, A, Bb, C
tap SAVE
wait 300
said Atmosphere page, character Surf
turn ALGO 2
wait 300
said Air
tap REC
wait 300
said HOLD
